          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Read treadmill reviews for patterns, not stars.</strong> Confirm
            each review describes your model and version, discount first-week and free-product reviews,
            sort the critical ones into delivery, seller and product complaints, and look for the same
            component failing for several owners, noting when it happens relative to the warranty.
          </p>
